{"parse": {"title": "漫漫之夜行迹-06", "pageid": 56395, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BC%AB%E6%BC%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%9C%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%B9-05\" title=\"漫漫之夜行迹-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">漫漫之夜行迹-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BC%AB%E6%BC%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%9C%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%B9-07\" title=\"漫漫之夜行迹-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TN</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.9C.89.E9.A1.B6.E4.B9.8B.E5.B1.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"有顶之屋\">有顶之屋</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 有顶之屋</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>210愤怒地离开之后，我听见船起航时人们呼喊的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这场争辩并不在计划之中，它不可避免地打乱了平衡，在天秤的一侧落下一捧灰尘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们并不沉重，甚至只一呼就可吹飞，但它们依旧造成了影响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>平衡开始倾斜。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_at_6kanchuangwai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_at_6kanchuangwai\"><img alt=\"1_4_at_6kanchuangwai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-1_4_at_6kanchuangwai.png/600px-Cg-1_4_at_6kanchuangwai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-1_4_at_6kanchuangwai.png/900px-Cg-1_4_at_6kanchuangwai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Cg-1_4_at_6kanchuangwai.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_at_6kanchuangwai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……闭关处不该是争吵的地方，从此以后，不应该轻易地与人交谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我并不喜欢说话。保持缄默，是学派成员恪守的美德。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但在漫长的独处中，我学会了和自己交谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>语言在没有倾听者时，便会减少影响，而增加自我梳理的进度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>这些书已经看完了。晚些的时候，将新的书目告诉协理者。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我伸出手，由书堆下层抽取，替换一本新的书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张卷轴被衣袖带动，从书脊的隙缝中滑落至地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一首我很熟悉的诗歌，在那些闭口不言的日子，我曾反复默念过上面的字句。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……《金言》。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>毕达哥拉斯最著名的言论集。它的记录者已不可考，诗言内容却隽永相传。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>要认真思考，要克制己身，要追求思想和灵魂的宝藏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-307901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"132\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>要尊敬诸神和至高的存在，尊重魔鬼和元素中的居民，超越低等的世俗本性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我第一次听到这首诗，是从艾尔玛的口中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那个时候，她还不是6，在人与人之间行走时，使用着自己的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那个时候，我还年幼，年幼到需要一个长辈为我读那些悠长的诗篇。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>艾尔玛姨妈，我不明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>这里说道：“命运正如一个巨大的磨盘，凡人在其上来回滚动，承受无穷的苦痛。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……我们非得这样吗？命运是这么坏的东西吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>艾尔玛姨妈？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>噢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾尔玛移开脸上的书籍，在凉亭下打了个哈欠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>……你还没有睡着？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>要我说，这天气可真是舒服，正适合在葡萄架下打盹……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾尔玛又合上了眼，对我手里的诗篇置若罔闻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>实际上，她并不是一个擅长带孩子的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她代替我的妈妈来照顾我。于她而言，这是一项工作，一份不得不承担的责任。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而我的母亲有更重要的事务——名为6的责任。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这责任终有一天也会属于我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>亚齐，你为什么不来这边打会儿盹呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>思考命运可不是你这个年龄的孩子该做的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>可是，我想要知道——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我急于征询自己的问题，可艾尔玛只是摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>噢，是的，你是个乖巧的孩子，从人们那里听了太多关于6，命运、真理、“启示”之类的宏大话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>可总是凝视这些抽象的概念，会让眼前的幸福溜走的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾尔玛抽走了我手里的诗篇，拍了拍我的背。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>来，亚齐，躺在这儿。今天是个好天气，这些葡萄也正值成熟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>我知道你还在想《金言》的劝诫——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>“极少有人知道如何摆脱自身的不幸，因为他们尚未看清自己的命运。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>但这些阳光、风声、小憩，同样也是我们自身的一部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>让我们一起躺在这吧，这是难得的好时光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾尔玛将《金言》盖在脸上，自顾自地重新睡去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她一直是一个幽默而轻松的人，在这个恪守戒律的岛上，就像鹅卵石里的玻璃珠一般突出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而我是一个孤僻且早熟的孩子，过早接受了那些如高山上沉岩一般凝重的训导。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>唯有在艾尔玛身边，我感到短暂的轻松。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……躺下，吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我听到鸟鸣，风语，远处海浪拍岸的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我阅读过许多高深的书目，背诵了许多古老的箴言，接触过许多复杂的计算。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但只有艾尔玛给了《金言》一页落满阳光的注解。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_ye\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一种恰到好处的温暖，一种不会带来任何焦虑的片刻寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像海岛边缘时不时扑到我脚尖的浪花，轻轻靠近，慢慢离开，偶尔带来清凉的感觉，足以让沙滩边的漫步变得舒适。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——她曾是这样的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>于是我走出有顶的家，踏入细软的沙地，体会她所言的理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>体会其他人称之为“玩闹”的时光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沙地湿润，海风咸涩，我的衣物变得沉重，皮肤黏腻得凝结出水珠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>巨大的海始终在我身侧，浪潮拍打沙地，却从未真正打湿我的躯体。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_ye\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>艾尔玛，我回……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我在玩闹上花费了太多时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>以至于忘记了，命运正如高山上的滚石，终有一天会降临在我们身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>6，最初的完全数，完满与和谐的象征。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在它显现于灵魂之时，天上的“启示”将加诸于身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>6会拥有无上的智慧、开拓的眼界、公正的权衡，十全十美，如一盏明灯，带领信仰者前进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但在这之后，我才意识到它真正意味着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>艾尔玛？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她没有回应我的呼唤，也没有回过头来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现在回忆起来，孩子天然敏锐的触觉在我的智慧之前发现了那些异常之处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我忽然感到恐惧，也不再询问，只是屏住呼吸，缓慢地挪动着脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾尔玛姨妈的背影近在咫尺，月光照射在她细软的金发上，变得无比温和。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……姨妈？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>嗯？啊……瞧瞧我，我居然一点儿也没注意到你回来了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>浪花席卷上来，没过了我的脚面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>我……喊了您很多次，您没有回应我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾尔玛的声音柔和，她的手也温热……变得滚烫。她揽住我的肩膀，将僵硬的我搂入怀抱之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海面上升，它攀上了我的小腿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>我在梳理思路，抱歉，我一点儿都没听到你的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>直到刚刚为止，我的脑子都是一团乱，不过现在好多了，现在我已经想清楚了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她为我梳理头发，擦去奔跑导致的汗水，整理领口的衣裳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>多可怜的孩子，你的身上尽是汗水，衣摆上有着老鼠的抓痕，你一定是遇上了它们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>不要害怕，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>“为你将做的事向神祈祷，祈求一切顺利。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我感觉到了，湿润感已经触及了我的下颌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——你是谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个问题哽在喉咙里，它噎得我几乎无法呼吸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>艾尔玛姨妈，这里是不是发生了什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众：</div><div>艾尔玛——还有亚齐，你们快跟我来——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人的呼喊声唐突传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他刚刚奔跑过，穿过小巷和街道，跑过传道者之厅，汗涔涔的皮肤在月光的照射下如同一层闪烁的鳞粉，正如图书中所描述的报丧骑士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众：</div><div>我们得快点，再快点……不然就要来不及了……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>不……已经来不及了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>“启示”已经降临……这意味着她——我的姐姐已经回归了真理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>智慧的叩击已经来到我的面前，它进入了我的脑海，使得我看见一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾尔玛拉住男人的手，将其从我的手臂上拿开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的声音平静，面色却悲戚，将头偏向了一侧，更用力地将我按进怀抱之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>……只是，亚齐，我可怜的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>我可怜的孩子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾尔玛在那一天成为了6。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个完满的数字、一个完美的人、一位出色的领导者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但6并不是艾尔玛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>放开我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我甩开她的手，拼命地奔跑，想要逃离这完满的涨潮之海。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到缺氧感将我吞没，我发现自己重新来到沙滩上，正在不自觉地默念《金言》。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我的忧惧因其而起，可当我感到彷徨时，我仍是回到了此处，就像年幼的孩子无法离家太远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>“为你将做的事向神祈祷”……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_at_64.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_at_64\"><img alt=\"1_4_at_64\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-1_4_at_64.png/600px-Cg-1_4_at_64.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-1_4_at_64.png/900px-Cg-1_4_at_64.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-1_4_at_64.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_at_64.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>朦胧间，我看到了那位新任6的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>完满，智慧，她的话语一如古老的箴言，明晰且无可挑剔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-513201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-513201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-513201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>“为你将做的事向神祈祷，祈求一切顺利。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-513201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-513201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-513201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>“当你熟悉了这一切，你便会知晓永恒的诸神与有死的凡人之体系。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-513201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-513201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-513201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>“知晓世间万物为何者所包容，又如何联结为一。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-513201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-513201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-513201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>“你将懂得，正如你应当懂得，宇宙在任何地方都是齐一的。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-513201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-513201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-513201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾尔玛：</div><div>“如此，你便不会盼望不该盼望的，亦不会受到蒙蔽。”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_ye_mohu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我无法再想下去了，最初的怀疑阻断了我的思绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……“启示”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>这就是……会降临在6身上的“启示”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海面彻底吞没了我的头顶，窒息感提醒着我……我永远地失去了一个熟知的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——而这就是那天上的祝福。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>后来的很长一段时间，我都没能获得安稳的睡眠。我常偷偷溜到沙滩，听着海浪的声音，直到疲惫合上我的双眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>意识模糊间，有那智慧的声音说——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“不要忧惧，孩子。‘谨记神之恩典降给凡人的灾厄，耐心忍耐。天命如此，切勿抱怨。’”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-513101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我恍惚地意识到什么，睁开眼睛，看见沉默的巨石在高山上俯瞰岛礁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它终有一天会碾过我，正如碾过每一个艾尔玛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我于是捂住耳朵，弯下身去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从此不再凝视高山上的巨石，也拒绝看向桌面之上摇摇欲坠的水瓶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……直到许久之后，我与一位叫苏菲亚的女孩交谈了片刻。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "漫漫之夜行迹-06"}}